    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82597" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί-ψυκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very cold, chill</i>, of
			places, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.649c
			</span></i> ; f.l. (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ
			ψῦχος</span>) in <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				16.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fanned all round</i> : hence, <i>fondled, beloved</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.59
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κάλλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>VS</u>
					p.455
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιψύκτης</span>
				(sic)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: περιπόθητος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
